It takes Carmen 10 minutes to complete or finish a crossword puzzle and 5 minutes to complete or finish a sudoku puzzle. Over the weekend she solved 3 crossword puzzles and 8 sudoku puzzles. How much time did she spend playing these games?,It takes Carmen 10 minutes to finish a crossword puzzle and 5 minutes to finish a sudoku puzzle. Over the weekend she solved 3 crossword puzzles and 8 sudoku puzzles. How much time did she spend playing these games?,70,70,70,70,"To solve the problem, we will calculate the total time Carmen spent solving crossword puzzles and sudoku puzzles separately, and then add the two times together.

### Step 1: Calculate the time spent on crossword puzzles
Carmen solved 3 crossword puzzles, and each crossword puzzle takes her 10 minutes to complete. Therefore:
\[
\text{Time spent on crossword puzzles} = 3 \times 10 = 30 \text{ minutes.}
\]

### Step 2: Calculate the time spent on sudoku puzzles
Carmen solved 8 sudoku puzzles, and each sudoku puzzle takes her 5 minutes to complete. Therefore:
\[
\text{Time spent on sudoku puzzles} = 8 \times 5 = 40 \text{ minutes.}
\]

### Step 3: Add the two times together
The total time Carmen spent playing these games is the sum of the time spent on crossword puzzles and sudoku puzzles:
\[
\text{Total time} = 30 + 40 = 70 \text{ minutes.}
\]

